<title>INDONESIA: Indonesia Ramayana nine-mth net jumps.</title>
<headline>Indonesia Ramayana nine-mth net jumps.</headline>
<dateline>JAKARTA 1996-11-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Nine months to Sept 30, 1996</p>
<p>		 (in billion rupiah unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit			    47.38 vs  28.19</p>
<p>    Gross profit			 171.11 vs 116.44</p>
<p>    Earnings per share (in rupiah)    272 vs 1.5</p>
<p>    Net sales			    617.71 vs 447.34</p>
<p>    Operating income		    61.84 vs  41.52</p>
<p>NOTE: PT Ramayana Lestari Sentosa is a department store. It was listed in Jakarta on July 24, 1996.</p>
</text>
